{
  "_comment": "Which checkouts a tape needs. One entry per tape: \"plugin\" is the page it belongs to, \"tape\" (default: the plugin) names demos/<tape>.tape and the output files, \"title\" and \"needs\" (other plugins of the family the shown feature depends on) go into the caption. A bare dep is one of the family (<owner>/<slug>.nvim); owner/repo@sha names a third-party dependency pinned to a commit. \"always\" is cloned for every tape (the colorscheme demos/init.lua picks up when present). Read by .github/workflows/demos.yml and the site's loader; the tape itself sets DEMO_PLUGIN/DEMO_DEPS for demos/init.lua.",
